abstract: >-
  dental-notes-benchmark is an open synthetic benchmark dataset for dental clinical
  note extraction and summarization. It includes multi-specialty synthetic dental
  encounter notes with ICD-10-CM diagnosis mappings, open internal procedure codes,
  tooth-level structured annotations, and summary targets for reproducible dental NLP
  research.
